sequenceDiagram
    participant OFAC as OFAC SDN feed
    actor Curator as Curator ring authority
    actor Crazy as Mr. Crazy's wallet
    actor Evil as Mr. Evil's wallet
    participant CurRing as Curator ring
    participant SubRing as Subscriber ring
    participant SPP

    Note over SubRing: Block source = curator, pinned at create_policy

    OFAC-->>Curator: the sanctions list names Mr. Evil's pubkey
    Curator->>CurRing: create_record(Block, evil_pubkey)
    CurRing->>SPP: the ban record lands in the shared tree
    Note over CurRing,SubRing: the ban binds the pubkey's owner tag, enforcement is in ring only

    Crazy--xEvil: ring transfer refused, the recipient owner tag holds a live Block record
    Note over Crazy: the wallet finds the ban at witness build, no proof exists for the payment
    Note over Crazy,SubRing: a patched wallet fails at the circuit, the ban record admits no non-inclusion witness

    OFAC-->>Curator: the sanctions list drops the pubkey
    Curator->>CurRing: update_record clears the ban
    Crazy->>Evil: ring transfer lands, absence proved through the cleared record
    Crazy->>SubRing: transact with one proof
    SubRing->>SPP: CPI ring_transact
